data.current_description:
Creates an order to install Local Inbound (LI) and Enhanced Local Service (ELS) telephone numbers from your inventory or to order Local Number Portability (LNP) for LI and ELS products.

You must pass the <code>x-customer-number</code> parameter in the header to complete this call successfully. For this endpoint, the <code>x-customer-number</code> is the same as your <strong>Child BusOrg</strong> ID or the BusOrg assigned to the billing account number (BAN).

<br>

#### Order configuration options

When making your request, the __ProductFeatureList__ and __orderMappingList__ arrays are a required group of name-value pairs. Required fields and order mapping name-value pairs will vary based on your chosen order configuration option. Listed below are the four order configuration options:

<br>

##### __Option 1: Local Number Portability (LNP) for Enhanced Local Service (ELS) products__ 

<details>
<summary>Click to view the required fields and ProductFeatureList array for option 1</summary>

__Required fields:__
```
productID
lnpIndicator
subscriberLineList
```

If you are placing an order to install LNP for ELS products, the following name-value pairs are required in the __ProductFeatureList__ array.


```
"ProductFeatureList": [
    {
       "attributeName": "customerServiceName",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "billingTelephoneNumber",
