##### __Option 3: New Enhanced Local Service (ELS) telephone numbers__

<details>
<summary>Click to view the required fields and orderMappingList array for option 3</summary>

__Required fields:__
```
productID
lnpIndicator
subscriberLineList
e911Option
```

If you are placing an order to install new ELS telephone numbers, the following name-value pairs are required in the __orderMappingList__ array.

```
"orderMappingList": [
    {
       "attributeName": "customerServiceName",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "billingTelephoneNumber",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "directoryListAction",
       "attributeValue": "A"
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "directoryListedStreetNumber",
       "attributeValue": ""
