       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "customerName",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "tnQuantity",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "tnLocNpa",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
                {
       "attributeName": "tnLocNxx ",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "tnLocCity",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "tnLocCty",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "tnLocState",
       "attributeValue": ""
    },
    {
       "attributeName": "tnLocZip",
       "attributeValue": ""
    }                                              
  ]    
```
<br>

__Note:__

- You must specify the __tnLocNpa__ and __tnLocNxx__ attributes to order by NXX. Each __attributeValue__ must have a length of three.

- You must specify the __tnLocCity__, __tnLocCty__, __tnLocState__, and __tnLocZip__ attributes to order by location. The __attributeValue__ for __tnLocZip__ must be a length of five.
</details>

